sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as Customer
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant GW as API Gateway (:8080)
    participant DS as Dispute Service (:8084)
    participant SS as Shipment Service (:8082)
    participant AS as Audit Service (:8085)
    participant NS as Notification Service (:8086)

    Customer->>UI: Submit Dispute ("Package Not Received", "CP-2024-001")
    UI->>GW: POST /api/disputes (with Bearer JWT)
    GW->>DS: Forward to lb://DISPUTE-SERVICE
    DS->>SS: GET /api/shipments/track/CP-2024-001 (Cross-service check)
    SS-->>DS: 200 OK (Shipment verified DELIVERED)
    DS->>DS: Persist Dispute (Status: OPEN, Ref: DISP-2024-001)
    DS->>AS: POST /api/audit/events (DISPUTE_CREATED)
    AS-->>DS: 201 Created
    DS->>NS: POST /api/notifications (User alert)
    NS-->>DS: 201 Created
    DS-->>GW: 201 Created (Dispute DTO)
    GW-->>UI: 201 Created
    UI-->>Customer: Display confirmation badge

